@startuml
actor Cidadao
participant "WhatsApp Business API" as WA
participant "Chatbot API" as Chatbot
participant "Backend API" as API
participant "Sistema de Conteudo" as ContentService
database "Banco de Dados" as DB

Cidadao -> WA : optar por receber conteudos
WA -> Chatbot : POST /webhook
Chatbot -> API : identificar cidadao por telefone
API --> Chatbot : cidadao identificado
Chatbot -> API : atualizar preferencia de conteudo
API -> ContentService : salvarPreferencia(citizen_id, true)
ContentService -> DB : upsert content_preferences
DB --> ContentService : ok
ContentService --> API : preferenciaSalva
API --> Chatbot : resposta
Chatbot -> WA : confirmar opcao
WA --> Cidadao : opcao registrada
@enduml
